==Tày==

===Pronunciation===
* {{tyz-IPA}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|tyz|tai-pro|*ʔaːnᴮ||to [[recite]]}}. Cognate with {{cog|nod|ᩋ᩵ᩣ᩠ᨶ}}, {{cog|lo|ອ່ານ}}, {{cog|blt|ꪮ꪿ꪱꪙ}}, {{cog|khb|ᦀᦱᧃᧈ}}, {{cog|shn|ဢၢၼ်ႇ}}, {{cog|aho|𑜒𑜃𑜫}}, {{cog|th|อ่าน}}. Compare {{cog|km|អាន}}.

===Verb===
{{tyz-verb|按}}

# to [[count]] (one by one); to [[number]]; to [[enumerate]]
#: {{ux|tyz|Nòn phồm '''án''' vài, nòn ngai '''án''' khẩu|Lie prone to count the buffaloes, lie supine upwards to count the grains}}
#: {{ux|tyz|度𫠯保'''按'''啓|tr=Tò lồng bấu '''án''' khái|Walking back, can no longer '''count''' how many steps taken}}
#: {{ux|tyz|𨀎𪪈開帝𱍭'''按'''鉼|tr=Khuốp pi khai đảy ngần '''án''' pẻng}}

